{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Director of Technology"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to describe the job position of Technology Director."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify key information about people's jobs and places of work in spoken or written contexts. "}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understand important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.  Exchange simple information on the design of an information system, computer architecture and hardware, and basic concepts on graphic design."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n4le01ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Simple Present Tense Review to Talk About Duties and Occupations"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "To state information related to occupations and duties you can use the <span class=\"strong\">simple present tense</span> , in affirmative, negative and interrogative forms respectively."}, {"type": "text", "content": "  <span class=\"strong\">Affirmative form</span><br>  <div class=\"center_text\"> Subject + Main verb + Complement</div>  Example:<br> <span class=\"italic\"> \u00b7\tJeremy manage<span class=\"strong\">s</span>  the contract negotiations with other companies.</span> <br> <br> You add an \u201c<span class=\"strong\">S</span> \u201d to the verbs conjugated with the third persons of singular: he, she and it. <br><br> <span class=\"strong\">Negative form</span>  <div class=\"center_text\"> Subject + Auxiliary verb Do/ Does + NOT + Main verb + Complement.</div>  Example:<br> <span class=\"italic\"> \u00b7\tJeremy <span class=\"strong\">doesn't</span>  manage the contract negotiations with other companies.</span>  <br><br> In the negative form, it's important to know that you can make the auxiliary verb shorter by using contractions: <br>  -Do + not = <span class=\"strong\">Don't</span><br> - Does + not = <span class=\"strong\">Doesn't</span><br><br>  You use the auxiliary <span class=\"strong\">do</span>  with the subject pronouns I, you, we and they. On the other hand, you use the auxiliary <span class=\"strong\">does</span>  with the subject pronouns he, she and it.<br><br>  <span class=\"strong\">Interrogative form</span>  <div class=\"center_text\"> Auxiliary verb Do/ Does + Subject + Main verb + Complement +? </div> Example:<br> <span class=\"italic\"> \u00b7\t<span class=\"strong\">Does</span><br>  Jeremy manage the contract negotiations with other companies? -\tYes, he <span class=\"strong\">does</span>.<br> -\tNo, he <span class=\"strong\">doesn't</span>.</span><br><br>  You use the auxiliary verbs <span class=\"strong\">do</span>  and <span class=\"strong\">does</span> the same as the negative form.<br><br>  Check the following chart with more examples in the <span class=\"strong\">affirmative, negative</span>  and <span class=\"strong\">interrogative</span>  forms.<br> \t "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"SIMPLE PRESENT TENSE\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Affirmative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Negative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Interrogative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I create procedure manuals.<br /> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">don't</span> create procedure manuals.<br /> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Do</span> you create procedure manuals?<br />   Yes, I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">do.</span><br /> No, I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">don't.</span><br />\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Ginna handle<span class=\\\"strong\\\">s</span> decisive technology projects.<br />\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Ginna <span class=\\\"strong\\\">doesn't</span> handle decisive technology projects.<br />\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Does</span> Ginna handle decisive technology projects?<br /><br />  Yes, she <span class=\\\"strong\\\">does.</span><br /> No, she <span class=\\\"strong\\\">doesn't.</span><br />\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Our computer security specialist manages that area. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do I need to administer the security systems?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "You don't administer the security systems."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Idioms on Technology"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<div align=\"justify\"><span class=\"strong\"> Idioms on Technology</span> are very usual in everyday language. It's important to know their accurate meaning in order to use them in your professional field, as well as in your daily conversations.</div><br />"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<div align=\"justify\">In the chart below, you can find three interesting idioms which come from the tech vocabulary:</div><br /><br /> "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"TECHNOLOGY IDIOMS\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Idiom\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">1. Run out of steam</span><br />\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To lose the impetus of doing something.<br />\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">2. Sputnik moment</span><br />\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To realize that you need to catch up with your goals or projects, even if you have to ask for help to others.<br />\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">3. Well-oiled machine</span><br />\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When everything in a company operates in the right way, you can say that it's a well-oiled machine.<br /> A well-oiled machine works well.<br />\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "It's very important that this director has leadership skills and doesn't run out of steam when facing any problem. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I promise the technology department is going to work like a well-oiled machine."}, {"type": "image", "content": "enpe8n4le01ob03img01.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "enpe8n4le01ob03img02.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "enpe8n4le01ob03img03.jpg"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "manage"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to administer or supervise"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We really need a director of technology for our company since someone is necessary to manage our multiple projects."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le01ob03aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "leadership"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the skill to lead and coordinate a group"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's very important that this director has leadership skills"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le01ob03aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "duty"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a function"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Which duties and responsibilities do you consider this job position requires?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le01ob03aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "apps"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "abbreviation of the computing word applications"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If it's true that he doesn't have to program or create apps, he must monitor, evaluate and approve any update."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le01ob03aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "enhancement"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an improvement in something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He must monitor, evaluate and approve any update, enhancement or replacement."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le01ob03aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "negotiation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a mutual agreement between two or more parties"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do I have to handle the contract negotiations?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le01ob03aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for a job offer as a technology director and read the requirements."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a  letter to the owner of the company explaining why you are the best candidate for that position."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Don't forget to include the grammar and the vocabulary of this lesson. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your work with a partner. "}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I search for a job offer as a technology director and read the requirements.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a  letter to the owner of the company explaining why I am the best candidate for that position. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I include the grammar and the vocabulary of this lesson and I share my work with a partner. "}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"video_src": "enpe8n4le01ob03re2vid01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miss Allen:</span> Good afternoon, are you Mr. Wilson?<br />"}, {"time": "2100", "image": "", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Wilson:</span> Good afternoon. Yes, I am. I'm here for the technology director position.<br />"}, {"time": "6000", "image": "", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miss Allen:</span> You know, we really need a director of technology for our company since someone is necessary to manage our multiple projects. It is very important that this director has leadership skills and doesn't run out of steam when facing any problem. This person needs to have vast knowledge to determine what the best technologies to implement are and which procedures and policies to follow in any particular situation.<br />"}, {"time": "30000", "image": "", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Wilson:</span> I see.<br />"}, {"time": "31000", "image": "", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miss Allen:</span>  Now then, which duties and responsibilities do you consider this job position requires?<br />"}, {"time": "36400", "image": "", "id": 5, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Wilson:</span> Well, a technology director has to be in charge of a few duties. First, developing IT programs. Second, implementing appropriate strategies. And third, supporting all IT-related processes. On the other hand, even if it's true that this person doesn't have to program or create apps, he must monitor, evaluate and approve any update, enhancement or replacement.<br />"}, {"time": "57600", "image": "", "id": 6, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miss Allen:</span> Congratulations, you're hired.<br />"}, {"time": "59300", "image": "", "id": 7, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Wilson:</span> Thanks, I promise the technology department is going to work like a well-oiled machine.<br />"}, {"time": "63500", "image": "", "id": 8, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miss Allen:</span> Do you have any questions about your new position?<br />"}, {"time": "66000", "image": "", "id": 9, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Wilson:</span> Yes! Do I have to handle the contract negotiations?<br />"}, {"time": "68500", "image": "", "id": 10, "text": "<b>Miss Allen: </b> Yes, you do.<br />"}, {"time": "69700", "image": "", "id": 11, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Wilson:</span> All right! Do I need to administer the security systems?<br />"}, {"time": "72600", "image": "", "id": 12, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miss Allen:</span> No, you don't administer the security systems. Our computer security specialist manages that area.<br />"}, {"time": "78600", "image": "", "id": 13, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Wilson:</span>  When should I start?<br />"}, {"time": "80000", "image": "", "id": 14, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miss Allen:</span> If it's possible today. We have many issues to talk about.<br />"}, {"time": "83300", "image": "", "id": 15, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Wilson:</span> Okay! Could I take a previous look at the existing systems?<br />"}, {"time": "86300", "image": "", "id": 16, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miss Allen:</span> Of course. Let's go.<br /></div>"}]}, "type": "video"}], "type": "video", "_data": [], "id": 5, "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about duties and responsibilities related to job positions in IT.  "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can discuss why an IT company needs a director of technology.  "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can ask questions related to a job occupation."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What are the most important job positions in IT? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Who are the most important technology executives in the world?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Let me introduce our new director of technology!"}], "id": 0, "img_path": ""}, {"stimuli_ids": [5], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "type": "STI", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I'm here for the job position of technology director!"}], "type": "instructions